                                                "sense_id": "f3ed5fe4-e7db-3685-8918-327ce324d977",
                                                "text": "... Bee Wise with Bee Pollen, Bee Propolis, Royal Jelly smoothies or other drinks, or it may be eaten plain as a snack food by the spoonful."
                                            },
